  "details": "Hello! Ive been dealing with this issue where at some point while playing the game, all of a sudden everything starts loading. Avatars won't load and get stuck on \"Queued...\" at 25% and won't go any further. I can't open profiles, sometimes when I attempt to go back to my home world, it would either give me an error message or it'll take like 10 minutes to actually register **then takes me to my home world...**. It's been a bug that's been happening for a week or two now and it only happens when playing on Linux Desktop. Not on PCVR through Linux. At least not that I recall.",
